<%# What is Rolodex %>
<article style="max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <h2>What is Rolodex?</h2>
  <p>
    Rolodex is a personal gift and birthday tracker built for people who genuinely care about
    the people in their lives, but occasionally forget that Sean's birthday is next Tuesday.
    We've all been there. 😅
  </p>
  <p>
    Keep track of everyone you love, when their birthdays are, what you've gifted them, and
    what you're thinking of getting next. No more last-minute panic buying.
  </p>
</article>

<hr>

